<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 446)</h2>
<p><b>The session that's always listened to.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>The studio watcher</b>: turn on Settings ▸ Sessions ▸ "Register shared sessions with the studio watcher" and every session you host gets an always-on seat that records notes, voice and marks around the clock — even when your Mac sleeps — writes a session file you can open directly, and sends the production a daily record. It appears in the peer list as <i>Studio Watcher</i>, because a recorded room should say so.</li>
<li><b>asobi:// links open sessions in the app</b> — the daily record's "open in Asobi" is one click.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
